This work consists of the files SlideMage_base.tex, SlideMage_setup.tex,
SlideMage_template_slidemage.tex, SlideMage_alt.lua, SlideMage_measure.lua,
beamerthemeSlideMage.sty and slidemage-logo.pdf/.svg.

beamerthemeSlideMage.sty is a MODIFIED VERSION of the Gotham beamer theme
(beamertheme-gotham), release v1.2.5.a, by Romain Noël. It keeps his copyright
notice and states its changes in its header, as section 6 of the LPPL 1.3c
requires:

