It is not the original, and Romain Noël does not maintain, support or endorse
it: report problems with it to the SlideMage project
(https://github.com/JuergenFleiss/slidemage), not to him. The original, unmodified
theme (beamer*themegotham.sty, gotham.dtx, gotham.ins) is available from
https://gitlab.com/RomainNOEL/beamertheme-gotham. SlideMage versions before
v10.0.0 shipped it unchanged in this folder.
